/-!
# R-52CF5DA1 stage 12b: the frozen leading contour evolution against the bounded interaction series

`prop:audit-finite-count-propagation` (GAUGE_RETARGETING.tex:101), proof paragraph "A4's functional-linearization
lemma, its one-overlap commutator bound and the same transfer deviations then compare the fixed marginals with those
generated by the bounded interaction series `N Σ_{n∈F} t_n L^v_{N,n}`, `L^v_{N,n} = -(2πκ)⁻¹ Re ∮_{Γ_n} S_N(z)/D_v(z) dz`,
up to scalar terms. The error is uniform on the time box and the chosen neighborhood."

The accepted PROP-026 theorem `MixedQuadratures.prop026_traceNorm_physical` is applied to the concatenated fixed
rectangles `Γ_n`, `n ∈ F` (weights `t_n`, stage 6/8 `fam`), with `F_θ(x) = Re(u_θ F_{n(θ)}(z_θ, x₀ + i x₁))`
(`F_n` the PROP-010 smooth compactly supported extensions), `s_θ = s(z_θ; v)`, `δ_θ = √(C/N)` (accepted PROP-008
second moments, stage 11a), `w_θ` the uniform bound of `|u_θ|` on the time box, `U = ℝ²`, `Q` a closed disc.  All
its hypotheses are PROVED here (smoothness, measurability `hFm`/`hdF` from joint continuity, the derivative bound
`hFb` from compact support, `Q`-containment).  Then
* **`C0N` identified**: `C_{0,N} = Σ_{n∈F} t_n C^{(0)}_{N,n}` (the operators of the accepted PROP-010 and of stage
  13a), on the complete Bethe basis (`cfc` on eigenvectors, `C0N_basis`; per-label contour integral
  `integral_rectFam_lab`);
* **`L_N` identified**: `L_N = Lop` with `d_θ = D_v(z_θ)⁻¹` (`MPOps.LN_eq_Lop`; the derivative hypothesis is supplied
  by stage 12a), and `N · Lop = scalar · 1 + Prop001.generator (frozen kernels)` (stage 4 `N_Lop_eq`); the scalar is
  a phase that the reduced density does not see;
* **`linear_bound`**: for every `k` there is `C` such that for all `q`, unit `v` satisfying the stage-12a
  denominator conditions on the rectangles, and all `t` in the box,
  `‖γ^{(k)}_{exp(-iNΣ t_n C^{(0)}_{N,n}) v^{⊗N}} - γ^{(k)}_{U_N(1) v^{⊗N}}‖₁ ≤ C √(C_unif/N)` (`N = k + q`, `U_N` the
  PROP-001 quantum evolution of the frozen-contour kernels with weight `u_θ/D_v(z_θ)`).
No hypothesis is added; all inherited modules are read-only.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 8000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
noncomputable section
